---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout title="404 页面不存在">
  <div class="reader-layout is-single">
    <section class="bento-card" style="text-align: center; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;">
      <div class="bento-head">
        <span class="bento-head-title">
          <span class="term-ascii-icon">!</span>
          <span>ERR_404 // BOULDER_NOT_FOUND</span>
        </span>
        <span class="bento-head-meta">EXIT_CODE: 404</span>
      </div>

      <pre
        class="ascii-slope-pre"
        style="display: inline-block; text-align: left; margin: 1rem auto; padding: 0.75rem 1.2rem;"
      >{`      ·    ╱▒▒▒
    λ     ╱▒▒▒▒▒
   ╱▒▒▒  ╱▒▒▒▒▒▒▒   [■] · · (巨石滚出了已知路径)
  ╱▒▒▒▒▒╱▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒`}</pre>

      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 2rem; margin: 0.4rem 0;">
        404 :: PATH_NOT_FOUND
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0.4rem 0 1.4rem;">
        你访问的页面不存在，可能已经被移动或删除了。
      </p>
      <div>
        <a class="term-btn is-primary" href={`${base}/`}>[← cd ~/home 返回山脚首页]</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
